{"id":"436d98ae01957594","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md","title":"ZFC Meas Sigma Algebra Generated","display":"df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated — ZFC Meas Sigma Algebra Generated","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated","aliases":["58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated","58-df-zfc-measure10-sigma-algebra-generated","58-df-zfc-measure2-sigma-algebra-generated","58-df-zfc-measure7-generated-sigma-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated — ZFC Meas Sigma Algebra Generated","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-sigma-algebra-generated</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-sigma-algebra-generated</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-generated-sigma-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated — ZFC Meas Sigma Algebra Generated"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,G,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,G,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S(\\mathcal A,G,X)\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land G\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(G\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\n\\to\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S(\\mathcal A,G,X)\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land G\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(G\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\n\\to\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final clause states minimality among all set-coded sigma algebras on the fixed carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> that contain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The measure10, measure2, and measure7 generated-sigma-algebra variants are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,G,\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}_S(\\mathcal A,G,X)\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land G\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(G\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\n\\to\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1385,"backlinks":[{"id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSigmaAlgebraGenerated}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2530","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated.md|58-df-zfc-meas-sigma-algebra-generated]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb